{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714070/extras/canyouremember.gif?t=1746782628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you remember who you are? Or why you\u2019re here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember is a PS1-style psychological horror game that drags you into a twisted world of fractured memories, eerie environments, and unanswered questions. As you explore decaying halls and surreal landscapes, the lines between past and present start to blur \u2014 and the truth gets harder to trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With low-resolution visuals, lo-fi sound, and a haunting narrative, Remember recreates the feel of late '90s horror while telling a deeply personal story of identity and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714070/extras/remembergun.gif?t=1746782628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Explore distorted environments that echo a forgotten past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Piece together the mystery through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Face surreal horrors \u2014 or run from them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Discover hidden messages and disturbing clues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Experience a short, intense story-driven journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you trust what you see? Can you escape? Can you... remember?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714070/extras/wishlistnow.gif?t=1746782628\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714070?t=1746782628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714070?t=1746782628","capsule_image":"https://sh